"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}]}}]}, {"stimuli_ids": [], "type": "DWS", "questions": [{"responses": [{"correct": 1, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "selected": 0, "id": 0}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"type": "pdf", "content": "engenn9le03ob03re7pdf01.pdf"}]}]}], "template_override": 1, "id": 11, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Create a master resume."}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Take Away"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}]}}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Writing"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Speaking"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self Assessment."}]}]}], "type": "scholar", "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}], "id": 0, "stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "id": 0, "contents": [{}]}, {"contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn9le03ob03re2img05.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn9le03ob03re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn9le03ob03re2img05.jpg", "text": "", "id": 0}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn9le03ob03re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: Hey! What are you up to?\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Bianca</span>: I'm working on my business plan.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: How's that going?\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Bianca</span>: Good. By writing a business plan, I'm forcing myself to look at the business from every angle. This plan defines my business, sets goals, creates a plan to generate revenue, lists expenses, describes my customer base, and examines my competition.", "id": 1}, {"time": "25000", "image": "engenn9le03ob03re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: Sounds like a lot to do on your own.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Bianca</span>: Well, I'm going to the bank later. I'm meeting with a financial advisor. One of the numbers I'll need to generate is the startup cost. Anyway, what are you doing today?\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: I'm going to spend the day identifying my skills and interests. I'll have to create a master resume too.", "id": 2}, {"time": "47000", "image": "engenn9le03ob03re2img06.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Bianca</span>: Great idea! Do you want some pointers?\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: Sure.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Bianca</span>: Start creating the largest section of your master resume. You can do this by using your old resumes. This section can be separated into categories like work or volunteer experience. Then, start listing items within the categories from most recent to oldest. This will make developing a targeted resume quick and easy.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: Okay. What about my skills?\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Bianca</span>: The next step is defining your top 3 - 5 skills and strengths.", "id": 3}, {"time": "86000", "image": "engenn9le03ob03re2img07.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: Gotcha.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Bianca</span>: After you've taken the time to create the content, spend some time formatting your master resume. Having an organized master resume ensures that you won't lose track of important information that could be included on one version of a resume but omitted from others. It is also worthwhile to have someone do some editing and proofreading.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: Of course.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Bianca</span>: Also, keeping your master resume up to date is important. Plan to regularly update it, perhaps once every two months, to make sure you don't forget anything!", "id": 4}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}]}], "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "The World of Work"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "My Master Resume"}, {"type": "position", "content": 3}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 3}, {"type": "level", "content": "B2.1"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Identify and describe jobs and careers in both work and social contexts appropriate for the interlocutor."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "What is a Gerund?"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "A gerund is a noun made from a verb by adding \"-ing\"."}, {"type": "text", "content": "It is an action verb that is acting as a noun. The noun refers to an activity instead of a person or thing. <span class=\"strong\">Gerunds </span>are written in their -ing form. You can use a gerund as the subject, the complement or the object of your sentence."}, {"type": "text", "content": "The <span class=\"strong\">gerund </span>can function as the subject of a sentence, either on its own or, as part of a phrase."}, {"type": "text", "content": "For example: <span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"underline\">Writing</span> (a business plan) makes you look at your business from all angles."}, {"type": "text", "content": "It can also be the object of your sentence after certain verbs like \u201c<span class=\"italic\">make\u201d. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "For example:  <span class=\"italic\">This <span class=\"strong\">makes </span><span class=\"underline\">creating</span> a master resume much easier."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Type\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Examples\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"The gerund as the subject of the sentence\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Having a master resume is a great help.<br>  Listing items in categories will help you stay organized.<br> Keeping your master resume up to date is important.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"The gerund as the complement of the sentence\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">The next step is choosing your top 3 skills.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"The gerund as the object of the sentence\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I liked doing PR.<br> This makes developing a resume easy.<br> Start listing items here.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "The Elements of a Master Resume"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "A master resume includes: <br><li>personal information (name, address, phone number, e-mail address) <br><li>your strengths and skills<br><li> current/past volunteer experience <br><li>education<br><li> work experience"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Your strengths and skills can be determined by looking at your volunteer and work experience."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<br/>List your current and past volunteer positions. Be mindful of which of these have helped you develop/showcase your strengths/skills."}, {"type": "text", "content": "List the formal education courses you have taken, in reverse-chronological order. This resume section usually only contains secondary and formal postsecondary institutions you've attended. If you haven't completed a diploma or degree, list the expected completion date or be clear about how many years you have completed. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "List all previous positions you've held."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<div class=\"center_text\">Your Name Street Address \u2022 City, State, Zip \u2022 Telephone number \u2022 E-mail</div><br><span class=\"strong\">Strengths/Skills"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<li>Strength/Skill #1 <br><li>Strength/Skill #2 <br><li>Strength/Skill #3 <br><li>Strength/Skill #4 <br><li>Strength/Skill #5"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Volunteer Experience</span><br>Organization: <br>Dates: <br>Role/Responsibility:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Education</span> <br>Institution: <br>Dates:<br> Course/Diploma/Degree:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Work Experience </span><br>Company: <br>Dates: <br>Role/Responsibility:"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "business plan "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a document which explains what a company wants to do in the future, and how it plans to do it "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'm working on my business plan. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le03ob03aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use when you want to open your business."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to define"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to describe something correctly and thoroughly, and to say what it has that makes it different from other things "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: This plan defines my business."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le03ob03aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "set goals "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the things you decide that you want to achieve "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Do you have set goals in mind?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le03ob03aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "generate revenue "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "  to produce money over a period of time from selling goods or services  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It's important to create a plan to generate revenue."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le03ob03aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "customer base"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "group of customers who repeatedly purchase the goods or services of a business, the main source of revenue for a company "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Can you describe your customer base?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le03ob03aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "financial advisor"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a professional who provides advice about managing money"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'm meeting with a financial advisor this afternoon."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le03ob03aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "startup cost "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the initial expenses necessary to start a business  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I need to generate the startup cost. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le03ob03aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to omit "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to not include something because it isn't necessary "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Some information is included on one version of a resume but omitted from another version. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le03ob03aud08"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn9le03ob03re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Look at the format a master resume follows on the following page."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Using that format and the information provided, create your own master resume. If you have no work experience, make up a few examples. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "When you are finished, show it to a friend. Have your friend edit your master resume."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Proofread his/her master resume. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Discuss your master resumes and future plans."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I create a master resume. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write down jobs. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "I proofread a partner's master resume."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I talk about my future plans. "}]}]}